OL,3,GNEWSAProposals to pedestrianise parts
OL,4,Aof Belfast city centre unveiled
OL,5,
OL,6,FProposals to significantly
OL,7,Fpedestrianise parts of Belfast city
OL,8,Fcentre have been unveiled.
OL,10,FA city centre-wide 20mph (32km/h) speed
OL,11,Flimit would also be introduced under
OL,12,Fthe proposals.
OL,14,FThe details are contained in the draft
OL,15,FEastern Transport Plan 2035, which is
OL,16,Fnow the subject of a 12-week public
OL,17,Fconsultation.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
