OL,3,GNEWSAProposals to pedestrianise parts
OL,4,Aof Belfast city centre unveiled
OL,5,
OL,6,FStormont's Infrastructure Minister Liz
OL,7,FKimmins said the plans would help
OL,8,Fdeliver a "modern transport system that
OL,9,Fbetter serves residents, businesses and
OL,10,Fvisitors alike".
